# Whatwg.Svg.Schema.Attributes

The attribute names of SVG 2, the attribute categories, and each element's attributes.
An attribute is a name: one name may take different values on different elements. An
element's attributes are `Tag.ownAttrs` and the members of `Tag.attrCategories`.

